So if this were America, it'd be like the TIME magazine or the New York whatever.

10
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:49,460
I'm saying this isn't something anyone can get their faces on.

11
00:02:49,460 --> 00:02:55,980
You have to be someone who could show up on the 9 o'clock news at least a few times

12
00:02:55,980 --> 00:03:01,380
