00:58:18,460 --> 00:58:20,590
I'll give it to him.

517
00:58:24,900 --> 00:58:29,600
Is there something wrong with Hyo Seon's taste buds?

518
00:58:29,600 --> 00:58:32,080
It's because she has a severe cold.

519
00:58:32,080 --> 00:58:34,910
That doesn't seem to be the case.

520
00:58:34,910 --> 00:58:39,860
You should take her to the hospital. She said no matter if it's rice,

521
00:58:39,860 --> 00:58:44,110
side dishes or alcohol, everything tastes like water to her.

522
00:58:45,670 --> 00:58:50,820
It seems like she has completely lost her taste buds. Completely.

523
00:59:02,430 --> 00:59:04,620
It's not salty at all.

524
00:59:08,150 --> 00:59:12,190
Goo Hyo Seon

525
00:59:12,190 --> 00:59:17,350
The number you have dialed is turned off...

526
00:59:17,350 --> 00:59:20,590
Mom

527
00:59:21,600 --> 00:59:26,340
The person you're calling is not able to take your call.

528
00:59:32,790 --> 00:59:35,990
Han Jeong Woo

529
00:59:39,760 --> 00:59:45,000
Jeong Woo, you can tell me now. I'm not as busy now.

530
00:59:45,000 --> 00:59:49,320
You seemed very tired so I couldn't say anything earlier.

531
00:59:49,320 --> 00:59:51,790
Joon Soo's second noona...

532
00:59:52,820 --> 00:59:57,250
found out about Ajusshi Jang.

533
00:59:57,250 --> 01:00:04,500
There were some things she found out herself, but I also...let a few things slip.

534
01:00:15,000 --> 01:00:17,600
What's wrong?

535
01:00:17,600 --> 01:00:20,070
It's like a lie...

536
01:00:24,360 --> 01:00:29,350
Everything is like a lie...

537
01:00:37,420 --> 01:00:42,840
What should we do...with Hyo Seon?

538
01:00:46,920 --> 01:00:49,960
That's why she's sick...

539
01:00:51,680 --> 01:00:56,130
That's why she can't taste anything...

540
01:01:04,350 --> 01:01:07,450
What should I do?

541
01:01:21,380 --> 01:01:24,160
What should I do?

542
01:01:27,970 --> 01:01:30,280
What should I do?

543
01:02:43,800 --> 01:02:45,220
Hello?

544
01:02:45,220 --> 01:02:46,340
Joon Soo...

545
01:02:46,340 --> 01:02:49,160
Second Noona, where's Mom?

546
01:02:50,520 --> 01:02:56,560
Mom...didn't go home?

547
01:02:56,560 --> 01:03:00,380
I don't know! Why isn't she back?!

548
01:03:12,740 --> 01:03:15,880
The last bus has left, Customer.

549
01:03:27,400 --> 01:03:30,020
So, this is how you're going to be...

550
01:03:32,370 --> 01:03:34,190
Mom,

551
01:03:38,350 --> 01:03:41,390
is this how you are going to do it?

552
01:04:24,700 --> 01:04:27,130
Mom...

553
01:04:31,320 --> 01:04:33,920
Mom...

554
01:04:37,780 --> 01:04:40,320
Mom!

555
01:04:44,200 --> 01:04:46,990
Mom, don't go!

556
01:04:48,120 --> 01:04:50,690
Mom, don't go!

557
01:04:50,690 --> 01:04:53,810
♫  It must be you  ♫

558
01:04:53,810 --> 01:04:57,970
♫  I cannot be without you ♫

559
01:04:57,970 --> 01:05:04,830
♫  Like this for another day, month or year  ♫

560
01:05:04,830 --> 01:05:08,280
♫  I don't mind even if I am hurt  ♫

561
01:05:08,280 --> 01:05:11,170
♫  I don't mind even if my heart breaks  ♫

562
01:05:11,170 --> 01:05:18,630
♫  because, yes, you are the only one I love  ♫

563
01:05:18,630 --> 01:05:29,400
♫  My bruised heart is shouting so that I can find you.  ♫

564
01:05:31,180 --> 01:05:34,660
♫  Wherever you are  ♫

565
01:05:34,660 --> 01:05:39,320
♫  Can't you hear my voice?  ♫
